      "index": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Color was another major focus. We delved deeply into the world of dark mode theming and high-contrast theming. Luckily for us, Figma rolled out their 2023 update, which included extremely critical color variable & layer theming functionalities.",
          "links": []
        }
